.TH NVCOMP-CLI 1 "December 2025" "nvCOMP 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nvcomp-cli \- GPU-accelerated compression command-line tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nvcomp-cli
.RB [ \-c | \-d | \-l ]
.RB [ \-a
.IR algorithm ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I input
.RI [ output ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nvcomp-cli
is a command-line interface for GPU-accelerated compression and decompression using NVIDIA CUDA. It supports multiple compression algorithms with automatic CPU fallback.
.SH MODES
.TP
.B \-c
Compress mode. Compress input file or directory.
.TP
.B \-d
Decompress mode. Decompress archive to output directory.
.TP
.B \-l
List mode. List contents of compressed archive.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-a\  algorithm\fR,\ \fB\-\-algorithm= algorithm
Compression algorithm to use: lz4, zstd, snappy, gdeflate, ans, bitcomp
.TP
.B \-\-cpu
Force CPU mode (disable GPU acceleration)
.TP
.BI \-\-volume\-size\  size
Set volume size for multi-volume archives (e.g., 1GB, 500MB, 5GB)
.br
Default: 2.5GB
.TP
.B \-\-no\-volumes
Disable multi-volume splitting (create single file)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display help message and exit
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Display version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Compress a file with LZ4 (GPU):
.B nvcomp-cli -c -a lz4 input.txt output.lz4
.TP
Compress a directory with Zstd:
.B nvcomp-cli -c -a zstd /path/to/folder output.zstd
.TP
Decompress archive (auto-detect algorithm):
.B nvcomp-cli -d archive.lz4 /path/to/output/
.TP
List archive contents:
.B nvcomp-cli -l archive.zstd
.TP
Compress with CPU fallback:
.B nvcomp-cli -c -a lz4 --cpu input.txt output.lz4
.TP
Compress with custom volume size:
.B nvcomp-cli -c -a lz4 --volume-size 1GB large_file.bin output.lz4
.TP
Compress without volume splitting:
.B nvcomp-cli -c -a lz4 --no-volumes input.txt output.lz4
.SH ALGORITHMS
Cross-compatible (GPU ↔ CPU):
.TP
.B lz4
Fast compression with good ratios. Recommended for general use.
.TP
.B zstd
Best compression ratios, slower. Best for archival.
.TP
.B snappy
Fastest compression, lower ratios. Best for speed.
.PP
GPU-only:
.TP
.B gdeflate
GPU-optimized DEFLATE implementation.
.TP
.B ans
Asymmetric Numeral Systems compression.
.TP
.B bitcomp
Lossless compression for numerical data.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
General error
.TP
.B 2
Invalid arguments
.TP
.B 3
CUDA/GPU error
.TP
.B 4
File I/O error
.SH MULTI-VOLUME ARCHIVES
For large files exceeding GPU memory (default 2.5GB per volume), archives are automatically split into multiple volumes:
.PP
.RS
output.vol001.lz4
.br
output.vol002.lz4
.br
output.vol003.lz4
.br
...
.RE
.PP
Decompression automatically detects and reassembles volumes.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES
Control which CUDA devices are visible
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/nvcomp-cli
Main executable
.TP
.I /usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libnvcomp_core.so
Core compression library
